   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "decode re-reads the weights and the\nKV cache from HBM for every token\n\nmore TB/s = more tokens per second\n(H200 4.8 TB/s · Ironwood 7.4 TB/s)\n\nsee C3",
   "originalText": "decode re-reads the weights and the\nKV cache from HBM for every token\n\nmore TB/s = more tokens per second\n(H200 4.8 TB/s · Ironwood 7.4 TB/s)\n\nsee C3",
