   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "HBM holds weights + KV cache\nKV cache grows with every token of context\n\nfixed GB per chip, so it's a trade:\nlonger context = fewer users at once\n\nsee C5",
   "originalText": "HBM holds weights + KV cache\nKV cache grows with every token of context\n\nfixed GB per chip, so it's a trade:\nlonger context = fewer users at once\n\nsee C5",
